{"lyrics":"[00:00.00] [Instrumental Intro]\n[Intro: Chief Keef]\n[00:12.74] (Beat Gang)\n[00:13.22] Huh-uh-uh-uh (Stuntman)\n[Chorus: Chief Keef & Juice WRLD]\n[00:15.08] Girl, you fucked up (Yeah)\n[00:15.80] And I ain't finna fuck around with you no more (Yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[00:17.96] I don't want nothin' to do with you no more (Yeah)\n[00:19.44] Ayy, car got them horses, I don't do Polos, yeah (Bitch, oh yeah, oh yeah,)\n[00:23.66] Girl, you're fine as fuck (Fine as fuck)\n[00:25.32] But I ain't gonna let you go and try, my love (Uh-uh)\n[00:28.36] Hit the beats, come and go and hide, my love (Uh-huh)\n[00:31.10] Had to get up out to go and hide, my love, yeah (Uh-huh)\n[Verse 1: Chief Keef & Juice WRLD]\n[00:34.92] She like dreadlocks (Uh-huh)\n[00:36.88] And I like the guns with the red dots (Uh-huh, brrt, brrt, brtt)\n[00:39.38] You're taggin' me, I'ma still wear your best watch (Ayy, ayy)\n[00:42.68] Pulled up dressed like a mascot (Skrrt, skrrt, bitch, ayy, ayy)\n[00:46.36] We red hot (Red hot; Yeah)\n[00:48.48] I ain't watching what my mans got (Uh-huh, bitch, come on)\n[00:52.08] You better not (Better not)\n[00:53.98] Bitch, we locked in like padlocks, yeah (Padlocks, yeah)\n[00:55.88] Was a half knot (Half knot)\n[00:56.54] Now I walked in, spent a half now, yeah (Half now, bitch)\n[01:03.24] In a Lamb' truck (Bitch, skrrt, skrrt)\n[01:04.78] Wish I could pull this bitch up on a lam block, yeah (Skrrt, skrrt, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[Bridge: Chief Keef & Juice WRLD]\n[01:08.82] She gon' wait it outside in the rain (In the rain)\n[01:11.30] For a nigga to get done hustlin' (Hustlin')\n[01:14.10] She be wantin' to buy a nigga things (Nigga things)\n[01:17.14] I ain't even get her nothin' (Get her nothin')\n[Interlude: Chief Keef & Juice WRLD]\n‎\n[01:30.56] Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh (Ayy, haha, ayy, haha, ayy, ayy, ayy, Juice WRLD, huh; Come on)\n[Verse 2: Juice WRLD]\n[01:32.46] Huh, Glo Limit (Glo Limit)‎\n[01:32.96] So you can't really tell us nothin' (You can't really tell us—)\n[01:35.60] Bitch, you can keep your heart, it's nothin' (You can keep your heart, it's nothin')\n[01:38.72] And if you try to set me up, gun bustin' (Try to set me up, gun bustin')\n[01:41.96] Huh-huh, no limits (No limits)\n[01:44.26] So I'ma give it all or nothin' (I'ma give it all or nothin')\n[01:47.38] Fuck her then don't call her, she turned to a stalker\n[01:50.12] Hit it so good, now she's limpin', need a walker\n[01:52.96] Rollin' up 'Woods, missing my hood\n[01:55.62] I'm a bully in this industry, young Suge\n[01:58.60] My niggas in your vicinity, what's good?\n[02:01.36] Fuck your ho, and then I pass her, no look\n[Bridge: Juice WRLD]\n[02:04.92] Uh, everywhere I go, I make it rain (Make it rain)\n[02:07.54] Uh, and I don't even like strip clubs (Uh-uh)\n[02:10.40] I just can't count anything (Anything)\n[02:13.02] Ben Frank out the bank, no dubs\n[Interlude: Juice WRLD]\n[02:15.46] Uh (Beat Gang), oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh (Stuntman)\n[Chorus: Chief Keef]\n[02:27.88] Girl, you fucked up\n[02:29.52] And I ain't finna fuck around with you no more\n[02:32.58] I don't want nothin' to do with you no more\n[02:35.04] Ayy, car got them horses, I don't do Polos, yeah\n[02:39.18] Girl, you're fine as fuck\n[02:40.84] But I ain't gonna let you go and try, my love\n[02:43.88] Hit the beats, come and go and hide, my love\n[02:46.60] Had to get up out to go and hide, my love, yeah","words":[[2.02,3.58,"[Intro:"],[3.84,6.66,"Chief"],[12.34,12.68,"Keef]"],[12.74,13.02,"(Beat"],[13.08,13.18,"Gang)"],[13.22,14.04,"Huh-uh-uh-uh"],[14.1,14.36,"(Stuntman)"],[14.42,14.52,"[Chorus:"],[14.56,14.66,"Chief"],[14.7,14.78,"Keef"],[14.8,14.82,"&"],[14.86,14.94,"Juice"],[14.98,15.04,"WRLD]"],[15.08,15.14,"Girl,"],[15.18,15.3,"you"],[15.36,15.52,"fucked"],[15.58,15.6,"up"],[15.66,15.76,"(Yeah)"],[15.8,15.84,"And"],[15.88,15.88,"I"],[15.92,16.0,"ain't"],[16.06,16.18,"finna"],[16.22,16.28,"fuck"],[17.0,17.16,"around"],[17.2,17.26,"with"],[17.3,17.34,"you"],[17.38,17.4,"no"],[17.